<title>UK: Sideco Americana sets $100 mln five-year bond.</title>
<headline>Sideco Americana sets $100 mln five-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-08-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead  manager Bear Stearns.</p>
<p> BORROWER   SIDECO AMERICANA SA</p>
<p> AMT    $100 MLN	COUPON     **	  MATURITY    07.AUG.02</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  **	  PAY DATE    07.AUG.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.00	REOFFER    **	  SPREAD	+325 BP</p>
<p> NOTES	**TO BE PRICED</p>
<p> MOODY	=	   LISTING    LUX	 PAY FREQ    SEMI-ANN</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  BB	  DENOMS (K) =	   SALE LIMITS US/UK/AR</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> MGT/UND    50 BP     SELL CONC  50 BP     TAX PROVS   STANDARD</p>
<p> UNDERLYING GOVT BOND THREE-YEAR U.S.T</p>
<p> NOTES	BANCO GALICIA IS JOINT LEAD MANAGER</p>
<p>		DIRECT, UNSECURED AND UNSECURED</p>
<p>		LAUNCHED OFF AN MTN PROGRAMME</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
